# Acceptable Use Policy for {{PRODUCT_NAME}}

**Effective date:** {{EFFECTIVE_DATE}}

This policy sets the rules for what you can post or do on {{PRODUCT_NAME}}. It is part of our [Terms of Service]({{TOS_URL}}).

## You must not
- Post anything illegal, or that helps someone else break the law.
- Harass, threaten, or promote violence against anyone.
- Post hate speech aimed at people because of who they are.
- Post sexual content involving minors. We report this to the authorities.
- Share other people's private information (home address, ID numbers, private photos) without their permission.
- Post content that infringes copyright, trademarks, or other rights. See our [DMCA policy]({{DMCA_URL}}).
- Impersonate a person or organization, or mislead people about who you are.
- Send spam, scams, phishing, or malware.
- Try to break, probe, overload, or bypass the limits of {{PRODUCT_NAME}}. Report security problems through our [Vulnerability Disclosure Policy]({{VDP_URL}}).
- Scrape or collect other users' data{{#api}} except through our documented API within its limits{{/api}}.
{{#ai_features}}- Use AI features to produce content that breaks this policy: {{AI_USE_RESTRICTIONS}}{{/ai_features}}
